{"4703910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moss Dwellers", "steam_appid": 4703910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moss Dwellers is a relaxing strategy game in which you place tiles to grow lush landscapes. In this turn based game you will place tiles and watch the world expand before you. Take your time and find the best path forward. If you are looking for a challenge, go for the high score or scale increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/323f3645eadb517f042bbd398d2fb194.avif?t=1788263786\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Moss Dwellers you start with a hand of cards, where each card allows you to place a tile in the world. Some tiles have abilities that can be triggered to get extra rewards. Plan ahead, and activate them at the correct time to score large amounts of points in one go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/5e77e70ee3ca779faf78c82716ebcd09.poster.avif?t=1788263786\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/5e77e70ee3ca779faf78c82716ebcd09.webm?t=1788263786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/5e77e70ee3ca779faf78c82716ebcd09.mp4?t=1788263786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your hand runs out, you draw new cards until your deck runs out. If you run out of cards, the game is over. In order to get more cards you need to score points, reaching thresholds to get bundles of new cards shuffled into your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play new biomes, tiles and cards will be unlocked that gives you more options to tailor the experience to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/7685088aa50470bcb00296d5c5c9fbe1.avif?t=1788263786\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Moss Dwellers offers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build lush landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mix of strategy and puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and calming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement to trigger chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value - every session is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unlockable tiles, biomes, relics and more...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Moss Dwellers does <strong>not</strong> offer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4X Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat &amp; Violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/0960ac47687572cef852e253a20d6a4d.avif?t=1788263786\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moss Dwellers was developed by two game designers from Göteborg, Sweden. Together we formed Vredesmood with the goal to develop small, original and high-quality indie games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love to hear constructive feedback, so feel free to contact us! We will do our best to respond to messages quickly and fix any problems that may arise.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moss Dwellers is a relaxing strategy game in which you place tiles to grow lush landscapes. In this turn based game you will place tiles and watch the world expand before you. Take your time and find the best path forward. If you are looking for a challenge, go for the high score or scale increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/323f3645eadb517f042bbd398d2fb194.avif?t=1788263786\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Moss Dwellers you start with a hand of cards, where each card allows you to place a tile in the world. Some tiles have abilities that can be triggered to get extra rewards. Plan ahead, and activate them at the correct time to score large amounts of points in one go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/5e77e70ee3ca779faf78c82716ebcd09.poster.avif?t=1788263786\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/5e77e70ee3ca779faf78c82716ebcd09.webm?t=1788263786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/5e77e70ee3ca779faf78c82716ebcd09.mp4?t=1788263786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your hand runs out, you draw new cards until your deck runs out. If you run out of cards, the game is over. In order to get more cards you need to score points, reaching thresholds to get bundles of new cards shuffled into your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play new biomes, tiles and cards will be unlocked that gives you more options to tailor the experience to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/7685088aa50470bcb00296d5c5c9fbe1.avif?t=1788263786\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Moss Dwellers offers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build lush landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mix of strategy and puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and calming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement to trigger chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value - every session is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unlockable tiles, biomes, relics and more...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Moss Dwellers does <strong>not</strong> offer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4X Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat &amp; Violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/extras/0960ac47687572cef852e253a20d6a4d.avif?t=1788263786\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moss Dwellers was developed by two game designers from Göteborg, Sweden. Together we formed Vredesmood with the goal to develop small, original and high-quality indie games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love to hear constructive feedback, so feel free to contact us! We will do our best to respond to messages quickly and fix any problems that may arise.</p>", "short_description": "Place, join and trigger chain reactions in this relaxing tile placement game. Build a world one tile at a time, with expanding mountain ranges, vibrant lakes and lush forests. Gather tiles and place them in clever combinations, letting small decisions snowball into satisfying outcomes.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/26f19fdfb622780a09276ade91663cc6ee52569d/header.jpg?t=1788263786", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/2aba7d2bcf58a0e5cc609ca41761b6e1714f61c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788263786", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/2aba7d2bcf58a0e5cc609ca41761b6e1714f61c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788263786", "website": "https://vredesmood.com/moss-dwellers", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core (Intel / AMD)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT550M | AMD Radeon R7/HD 5650 | Intel HD 520<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> your motherboard probably has one</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any recent distro will probably work<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core (Intel / AMD)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT550M | AMD Radeon R7/HD 5650 | Intel HD 520<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> your motherboard probably has one</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Vredesmood"], "publishers": ["Vredesmood"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/c9e7a46e94a50f9f9f6fb21c1d01ccf332811f6e/ss_c9e7a46e94a50f9f9f6fb21c1d01ccf332811f6e.600x338.jpg?t=1788263786", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/c9e7a46e94a50f9f9f6fb21c1d01ccf332811f6e/ss_c9e7a46e94a50f9f9f6fb21c1d01ccf332811f6e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788263786"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/7901274014ea2dfa006c8b6db5adf0e4486b571e/ss_7901274014ea2dfa006c8b6db5adf0e4486b571e.600x338.jpg?t=1788263786", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/7901274014ea2dfa006c8b6db5adf0e4486b571e/ss_7901274014ea2dfa006c8b6db5adf0e4486b571e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788263786"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/4321c587ce851a9eac57bece0f63de650dd89451/ss_4321c587ce851a9eac57bece0f63de650dd89451.600x338.jpg?t=1788263786", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703910/4321c587ce851a9eac57bece0f63de650dd89451/ss_4321c587ce851a9eac57bece0f63de650dd89451.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788263786"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s